; The Homey CLI runs `npm ls` on the app directory before uploading, so this project
; needs a plain npm-managed node_modules (pnpm's layout makes that check fail).
;
; Mirrors the 7-day release cooldown from ~/.npmrc instead of its stale global
; `before` date, so new versions still have to age before they land here.
; Bump this roughly monthly to (today - 7 days).
before=2026-09-14
